# Optional. The stack runs without a .env: config/btms-portal-frontend.env defaults every portal
# auth setting to work with cdp-defra-id-stub. Uncomment a line only to override that default, e.g.
# to sign in with real Entra ID test credentials (ask the team).

# btms-portal-frontend
